  "description": "NEW TO THE MARKET\n\nBOHAUN, KILTIMAGH, CO. MAYO\nF12 TY26\n\n3-BEDROOM COUNTRY BUNGALOW, OUTBUILDINGS & c.2 ACRES\n\nFOR OUTRIGHT SALE\n\nASKING PRICE: €90,000 O.N.O.\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present to the market this three-bedroom country bungalow together with outbuildings on approximately 2 acres at Bohaun, Kiltimagh, Co. Mayo.\n\nSituated between Knock and Kiltimagh, the property represents an opportunity for a purchaser seeking a country residence with additional ground and outbuildings.\n\nTHE RESIDENCE\n\nThe bungalow is in need of extensive repair and refurbishment and is not currently in liveable condition.\n\nThe roof requires attention and the property provides considerable scope for renovation and improvement.\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\n• Front porch\n• Sitting room\n• Day room with open fireplace\n• Kitchenette\n• Three bedrooms\n\nOUTSIDE & OUTBUILDINGS\n\nThe residence is being offered on approximately 2 acres together with associated outbuildings.\n\nThe additional ground and buildings provide useful space for storage, agricultural use or other appropriate uses, subject to any necessary permissions.\n\nSERVICES\n\n• Electricity\n• Piped water\n• Septic tank\n• Oil-fired central heating\n• Telephone connection\n\nLOCATION\n\nThe property is situated at Bohaun, Kiltimagh, Co. Mayo, between Knock and Kiltimagh and just off the main routeway.\n\nEircode: F12 TY26\n\nOVERALL\n\nAn opportunity to acquire a three-bedroom country bungalow requiring renovation, together with outbuildings and approximately 2 acres in a convenient rural location.\n\nASKING PRICE: €90,000 O.N.O.\n\nVIEWING\n\nStrictly by appointment with the Sole Selling Agents.\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\n\nNigel Dineen MIPAV MMCEPI\n086 213 0723\n\nOffice\n094 936 2216\n\nSOLE SELLING AGENT\n\nEverything We Touch Turns to SOLD.\n\nDISCLAIMER:\nThese particulars are issued for guidance purposes only and do not form part of any contract. Areas, measurements and distances are approximate. Intending purchasers should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy of all information, boundaries, services, acreage and other matters relating to the property.",
